1. Objectives of Testing
The main objectives are to:

Verify every feature works as specified.

Ensure Gemini generates valid structured workout plans.

Check that user inputs are correctly processed.

Verify database operations.

Test frontend and backend integration.

Identify and fix bugs.

Test application security.

Check responsiveness and usability.

Ensure inappropriate or invalid AI output is handled safely.

