13. Sample Test Case
Test Case: Generate Personalized Workout
Test ID: TC-001

Input:

Goal: Muscle Gain
Experience: Beginner
Days: 4
Duration: 45 minutes
Equipment: Dumbbells

Steps:

Login.

Open Fitness Assessment.

Enter the above information.

Click Generate Plan.

Wait for Gemini response.

Display generated workout.

Expected Result:

A valid 4-day workout plan is generated containing exercises, sets, repetitions, rest periods, and workout durations compatible with the submitted requirements.

Status: Pass/Fail

