Testing Outcome
The testing phase should establish that the complete FitBuddy-AI workflow is reliable:

User → Fitness Assessment → Gemini → Personalized Plan → Workout → Tracking → Progress

Once these tests pass, the project can move to the deployment and maintenance phase.


